      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So if I get this right. in essence, you want a co-owner tag a Tag that gives a select group of individuals from your social group's permission to visit the World you made that would normally be set to private. So Public people can not use it? I don't see why that can not be done with you being overall Owner tag of said world and your select group of individuals be set to Co-owner of said world. Mean anyone with an owner or co-owner tags can come and go as they please to the world even if the world is set to Private. while for the public player it won't show up unless the world has the friends of friends setting on the instance.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
