      "mergeID": "6639f6b5d502b81fb2fa3489",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Ability for world creators to bind one of their worlds to a group they own.\n\nThis would allow moderators of that group to come into any public-non-group instance and moderate said public-non-group instance and not limit it to only the world creator.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Bind your worlds to one of your groups",
