      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6639f6d0063c114bc4733ab1",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Pretty much just the title.\n\nConsidering the growing importance of groups in VRChat and being tied more and more with groups for queues, instances, events, and the new Creator Economy, allowing world creators to endorse or have their world be linked in any way easily found by the end user to a group is gonna become more and more important to limit friction of users trying to find related information to what they're interested into\n\nThink of music events worlds being in the active world discovery, and linking directly to a group without having to search for it, allowing an almost direct way to join ongoing or future events, or interest groups like flight sims etc to find instances with people to meet of the same interest group.\n\nTLDR: Add a way to direct link a group on a world's page ingame and on the website etc to lessen friction and allow faster discovery to directly related content.\n\nAdding onto it, the opposite is also true. groups made specifically for a world should be able to directly link to a world (or multiple, like a selection of worlds that are related to group activities or supported by its economy benefits), especially with the Creator Economy features it adds.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "World is represented/linked to a group",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "639a89e41fae6f7eb9461243",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
    {
