      "mergeID": "6639f6e94841bfd53888a73d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be really handy to create a world that can only be joined by a specific group of people.\nMost people have long friends lists, and sometimes you want to go on a world, have a few good friends pop up unannounced, and have a fun time. But often, friends you don't really want to see may pop up.\nWhat if we had a feature where when creating the world or by changing our status, we could make our session joinable by a specific group of friends. We can already sort our friend list into groups, why not add more functionality to that?",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Worlds only specific groups of friends can join",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "639a89e41fae6f7eb9461243",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
